{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01S5hcB2dCRkd1nxZ4s4k8aC","type":"tool_result","content":"// src/game/sim/sim.js: the race simulation. Pure JS, no engine, no DOM. Metres, seconds, kg, newtons, radians. Y up.\n// Heading yaw: 0 faces +Z; forward = (sin yaw, cos yaw); the driver's right = (-cos yaw, sin yaw). Steer > 0 turns right.\n  return { steer: Math.max(-1, Math.min(1, delta / limit)), throttle, brake: err\n}\n// src/game/data/tracks.js: every circuit as a closed polygon with rounded corne\n};\n// src/game/data/cars.js, physics rows: the stock setup of each car. Prices, yea\n};\nG,RHO,SURFACES,aiDrive,buildTrack,carParams,collideCars,locate,newCar,racingLine,speedProfile,stepCar,torqueShape\nkestrel 3430 383,593,757,940,1193,1413,1638,1764,1968,2154,2372,2669,2862,3052\ncedar 3216 \nharbour 2973 \nsaltline 2909 \nredclay 2209 \nproving 3020 \n5:## Sections\n23:## 1. Engine and games\n25:### ADAPTIVE_ASPECT\n33:### type AspectMode\n39:### BUILTIN_MODELS\n47:### chunkyResolution()\n55:### clearScene()\n63:### computeFraming()\n69:### countObjects()\n77:### type DebugAction\n87:### type DebugKeyChanges\n95:### type DebugKeyMap\n101:### type DebugKeysOption\n114:### DEFAULT_DEBUG_KEYS\n122:### disposeObject()\n132:### class Engine\n197:### ENGINE_VERSION\n203:### interface EngineOptions\n226:### FPS_OPTIONS\n232:### class FrameLimiter\n242:### frameView()\n253:### interface Framing\n266:### interface Game\n288:### interface GameContext\n305:### interface HeadlessOptions\n312:### class LoadingScreen\n323:### loadSettings()\n331:### normalizeSettings()\n339:### optionsFromUrl()\n352:### PIXEL_SIZES\n358:### interface PlayerSettings\n372:### QUALITY\n381:### QUALITY_LEVELS\n387:### QUALITY_OPTIONS\n393:### type QualityLevel\n407:### type QualityOption\n413:### interface QualitySettings\n418:### rebindDebugKeys()\n428:### interface Resolution\n446:### RESOLUTIONS\n452:### resolveDebugKeys()\n460:### class Settings\n479:### interface SettingsHost\n492:### class SettingsPanel\n507:### storeSettings()\n513:### urlSettings()\n523:### interface Viewport\n531:### withUrlOptions()\n542:## 2. Camera\n544:### CAMERA_PRESETS\n550:### interface CameraConfig\n566:### type CameraPreset\n577:### class CameraRig\n604:### interface CameraRigState\n617:### createCameraRig()\n623:### class FirstPersonRig\n637:### class FreeRig\n655:### class OrthoRig\n666:### class ThirdPersonRig\n677:## 3. Rendering, looks and filters\n679:### AMOUNT\n687:### applyFilter()\n696:### applyFilters()\n704:### type BackendName\n712:### interface CapturedFrame\n718:### clampParam()\n726:### cloneLook()\n732:### DEFAULT_EDGES\n738:### DEFAULT_PIXEL\n744:### defaultLook()\n752:### defaultParams()\n760:### interface EdgeSettings\n765:### FILTER_IDS\n771:### FILTER_PRESETS\n779:### interface FilterContext\n786:### interface FilterDef\n798:### type FilterGroup\n804:### filterOrder()\n812:### interface FilterParam\n824:### filterParams()\n832:### filterPresetOf()\n842:### filterPresets()\n850:### FILTERS\n856:### type FilterSpace\n862:### getFilter()\n868:### interface LayerLook\n875:### interface Look\n881:### LOOK_ALIASES\n889:### LOOK_PRESETS\n899:### LOOK_TARGET_LABELS\n905:### LOOK_TARGETS\n911:### interface LookFilter\n918:### lookFilters()\n926:### lookFromFilters()\n934:### type LookLayer\n942:### lookLayerOf()\n950:### interface LookPlan\n957:### lookPresetLabel()\n965:### lookPresetName()\n973:### lookPresetOf()\n981:### looksEqual()\n987:### type LookTarget\n995:### NO_WEBGPU\n1003:### normalizeLook()\n1013:### PALETTES\n1019:### paramsOf()\n1027:### PIXEL_PARAMS\n1033:### PIXEL_PRESETS\n1039:### interface PixelLook\n1047:### class PixelRenderer\n1103:### planLook()\n1112:### type RenderMode\n1118:### scenePixel()\n1126:### setLookLayer()\n1136:### splitFilters()\n1146:## 4. Materials, meshes and lights\n1148:### interface AssignItem\n1159:### class ContactShadow\n1169:### flicker()\n1178:### FLICKER_PRESETS","is_error":fals