{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018mTogbVD1yQgkLwZnSKhaG","type":"tool_result","content":"2\nfellow WON 13800 CR, day 6\nlicence B 18800 CR, day 6\nbought moth 18800 CR, day 6\n  feather round 0 cedar P 1 of 7 122.0 pits 0 19800 CR, day 7\n  feather round 1 kestrel P 1 of 7 122.8 pits 0 22800 CR, day 8\n  feather round 2 harbour P 2 of 7 141.5 pits 0 32600 CR, day 9\nfeather WON 32600 CR, day 9\nbought ginga 17800 CR, day 9\n  society round 0 kestrel P 4 of 7 140.2 pits 0 7800 CR, day 10\n  society round 1 saltline P 1 of 7 62.3 pits 0 21300 CR, day 11\nsociety WON 21300 CR, day 11\n  clay round 0 redclay P 1 of 2 136.5 pits 0 22800 CR, day 12\n  clay round 1 redclay P 1 of 2 136.6 pits 0 26800 CR, day 13\n  clay round 2 redclay P 2 of 2 136.6 pits 0 29200 CR, day 14\nclay WON 29200 CR, day 14\nlicence A 64200 CR, day 14\n  touring round 0 cedar P 1 of 8 108.7 pits 0 67500 CR, day 15\n  touring round 1 harbour P 2 of 8 128.0 pits 0 71100 CR, day 16\n  touring round 2 saltline P 1 of 8 58.9 pits 0 77100 CR, day 17\n  touring round 3 kestrel P 1 of 8 110.2 pits 0 123100 CR, day 18\ntouring WON 123100 CR, day 18\n  h200 round 0 harbour P 1 of 8 111.8 pits 3 143100 CR, day 19\nh200 WON 143100 CR, day 19\n  gp round 0 kestrel P 6 of 8 111.5 pits 0 124900 CR, day 20\n  gp round 1 cedar P 1 of 8 96.3 pits 0 154900 CR, day 21\n  gp round 2 saltline P 8 of 8 57.3 pits 0 154900 CR, day 22\n  gp round 3 harbour P 6 of 8 123.8 pits 0 154900 CR, day 23\ngp lost 154900 CR, day 23\n  gp round 0 kestrel P 1 of 8 98.4 pits 0 184900 CR, day 24\n  gp round 1 cedar P 1 of 8 96.2 pits 0 214900 CR, day 25\n  gp round 2 saltline P 6 of 8 59.4 pits 0 214900 CR, day 26\n  gp round 3 harbour P 1 of 8 109.9 pits 0 244900 CR, day 27\ngp WON 244900 CR, day 27\nfinished 244900 CR, day 27 cars kite,pico,kiteCup,ginga,ryuRally,corsa,works,type9 km 334\n@@RESULT {\"passed\":169,\"failed\":1,\"failures\":[\"buys the moth: 18800 CR, day 6\"]}\nexit 0","is_erro