{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DVNCjrTBcZ1vajCWu9w7R4","type":"tool_result","content":"check.mjs: /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-171904__x89353d/work/GranTumbleweed-GranTurismo3ASpec-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-171904/tools/sheets.mjs is outside /home/micha/dev/c\n\ncheck.mjs: play a Pixel Engine game in a real browser and report what happened.\nShips in the engine kit; run it before you hand a game back.\n\n  node check.mjs                       index.html in the current folder\n--- exit 2\n9://   node check.mjs --sheets models.js    sheets of your own models and textures (no page played)\n18://   --sheets models.js,crate,cobbles draw sheets instead of playing a page (ASSETS.md): every\n22://                                    in --out (default ./check/sheets); exit 1 on any problem\n36:// engine or GPU) and drew a picture (with --sheets: every sheet was drawn and no\n55:const VALUE = new Set(['keys', 'looks', 'out', 'size', 'sheets']);\n75:// --sheets \"\" is still --sheets (drawSheets says it needs something to draw), never a page run\n76:const sheets = opts.sheets !== undefined;\n77:if (sheets && positional.length) fail(`--sheets draws sheets instead of playing a page: play ${positional[0]} in a run of its own`);\n79:if (headless && (sheets || opts.cameras || opts.looks)) fail('--headless plays the game in Node, with no pictures: --sheets, --cameras and --looks need the browser');\n81:const out = resolve(opts.out ?? (sheets ? 'check/sheets' : 'check'));\n118:/** The empty page --sheets draws on (served at /__sheets__.html; it imports the engine itself). */\n119:const SHEETS_PAGE = '<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"data:,\"><title>sheets</title></head><body></body></html>';","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"674da8de-a5ac-4f57-8bff-2435f9aacc94","uuid":"6985c902-3d75-4801-b0fe-5da7c141afeb","timestamp":"2026