{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CLToN5obqv7a2n79Q66Ju2","type":"tool_result","content":"=== STAGE.md\nBuild the game PLAN.md describes. Take your file names and what to hand in from TASK.md, which is filled in for you. Keep your progress in PROGRESS.md, so you can pick up where you were after your context is compacted.\n\n=== TASK.md: what this computer lacks (quoted)\nNo script can check these, so they're written by hand. Test with the stand-ins; anything that needs the real thing is checked as far as it can be here, never required.\n- **No physical controller.** Emulate one: replace navigator.getGamepads with a stub that returns a pad in the standard mapping (Playwright's add_init_script / addInitScript).\n- **No touch device.** Use Playwright's phone and tablet profiles, which have touch, and tap with page.touchscreen.\n- **Nobody to listen.** Check sound by what Web Audio produces: render it with an OfflineAudioContext, or read levels from an AnalyserNode.\n- **No second player.** Play multiplayer with two browser pages (or contexts) on this computer.\n- **No real iPhone or iPad.** WebKit with an iPhone profile is the closest; it isn't iOS Safari.\n- **No TV.** Judge the 10-foot view from screenshots at 1920×1080.\n\n=== PLAN.md: 'Before you stop' (quoted)\n- [ ] `node tools/test.mjs` is all green, with the hub suite passing all three runs.\n- [ ] The scripted playthrough finishes the career with no Dev tools.\n- [ ] The built HTML runs from `file://`, with `session.js` unmodified and first in `<head>`, and `pixel-engine.js` unedited in `src/`.\n- [ ] Music starts at 10% on a fresh profile and in a session.\n- [ ] Grep for `TODO`, `FIXME`, `placeholder`, `stub`, `coming soon`: nothing in the game.\n- [ ] Every menu item does something. Every car, track, test and event is reachable.\n- [ ] You looked at the 1080p screenshots.\n- [ ] About/Credits shows real answers. The exit-interview file parses as JSON. Your chat reply carries the same information.\n- [ ] No stray servers or browsers of yours left running.\n\n--- PLAN section 18 and the brief\nPASS Title: playful riff, picked by a real RNG; TITLE constant  [code]\nPASS Engine unchanged (compared to a fresh kit download earlier; no edits since)  [code]\nPASS Audio only in code; music 10% on fresh profile  [test]\nPASS Music 10% in a session  [test]\nPASS Reset restores 10%  [test]\nPASS Gibberish voices with subtitles; same words same sound  [test]\nPASS Hub: 2 players, 4 with latency, host leaving  [test]\nPASS Hub rule: menu never pauses, no quit  [test]\nPASS Hub: follow a ghost after finishing  [test]\nPASS Couch Duel: two engines, then disposed  [test]\nPASS Pad 1 is P1, pad 2 is P2  [test]\nPASS Whole-career bot, no Dev tools  [test]\nPASS Ending reached, Type 9 won  [test]\nPASS Dev mode on pause menu; sliders change env; reset  [test]\nPASS Every dev tool exercised  [test]\nPASS Attract at 10 s; any input exits; save untouched  [test]\nPASS Every attract clip runs  [test]\nPASS Pad drives every top-level screen  [test]\nPASS Prompts follow pad, keyboard, mouse  [test]\nPASS Xbox glyphs setting  [test]\nPASS Hover moves focus, click confirms, right click back  [test]\nPASS Options ignored while Create held  [test]\nPASS Touch-only gate, settings tap, attract runs  [test]\nPASS No on-screen controls  [test]\nPASS Pad lifts the gate  [test]\nPASS No WebGPU: a plain line  [test]\nPASS Runs from file://, no errors  [test]\nPASS URL flags  [test]\nPASS Every look  [test]\nPASS About has every field and section  [test]\nPASS Save survives a migration  [test]\nPASS Recording replays to same fingerprint  [test]\nPASS check.mjs --headless  [test]\n--- PLAN sections 5 to 11\nPASS Regression numbers, each car on each track  [test]\nPASS Keyboard-style driver, no recoveries  [test]\nPASS Rolling start  [test]\nPASS Standing test on five lights  [test]\nPASS Pit stop: autopilot, crew, skip tyres  [code]\nPASS Rally: stagger, clock decides  [test]\nPASS Reverse, manual gears, airborne, contact  [test]\nPASS Replay director prefers slide or battle  [code]\nPASS Replay controls  [test]\nPASS Replay saved, compressed, plays back  [test]\nPASS 14 cars, 5 layouts  [test]\nPASS Oil, wash, mud  [test]\nPASS Licences, medals, all-gold prizes  [test]\nPASS Time trial ghost  [test]\nPASS Arcade pickers, all three modes  [test]\nPASS Event retry undoes a round  [test]\nPASS New clips pass analyzeClip  [test]\nPASS Engine synth: centroid rises with rpm  [test]\nPASS Live mix non-silent; counts move  [test]\nPASS Every song at 10% well under effects  [test]\nPASS H200 dressed for night  [test]\nPASS Text fits 60 chars and 4 lines  [test]\nPASS Designer docs  [file]\nrequirement rows failing: 0\n--- hand-in files\n 5860815 Nov  5 20:40 ../GranTumbleweed-GranTurismo3ASpec-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-171904.html\n    6219 Nov  5 20:40 ../exit-interview.json\nexit-interview parses; usage = added on import\n39 by my count: 13 from the scripted suites and the career b\nbuilt\nHTML current: yes\n1\ntests: 1512 passed, 0 failed\nstray browsers or servers of mine: 0\n[This command modified 1 file you've previously read: ../PROGRESS.md. Call Read before editing.]","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"674da8de-a5ac-4f57-8bff-2435f9aacc94","uuid":"e92e5188-371f-4203-aaf5-1c7e5ff28def","timestamp":"2026-11-06T03:52:08.751Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"=== STAGE.md\nBuild the game PLAN.md describes. Take your file names and what to hand in from TASK.md, which is filled in for you. Keep your progress in PROGRESS.md, so you can pick up where you were after your context is compacted.\n\n=== TASK.md: what this computer lacks (quoted)\nNo script can check these, so they're written by hand. Test with the stand-ins; anything that needs the real thing is checked as far as it can be here, never required.\n- **No physical controller.** Emulate one: replace navigator.getGamepads with a stub that returns a pad