{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015gq89z84QY5bgbsqypogmv","type":"tool_result","content":"2634:### interface Voice\n2635-\n2636-A looping sound steered while it plays (`AudioManager.loop`): a hum, a fire, a waterfall.\n2637-\n2638-- `readonly name: string`\n2639-- `readonly settings: Readonly<Required<VoiceSettings>>`: The values last set (kept headless too, so games and tests can read them).\n2640-- `readonly sounding: boolean`: Really sounding: Web Audio running and the loop started.\n2641-- `readonly stopped: boolean`\n2642-- `set(s: VoiceSettings): void`: Change any of its settings; they glide over a few hundredths of a second (no clicks).\n2643-- `stop(): void`\n2644-\n2645:### interface VoiceSettings\n2646-\n2647-- `volume?: number`: 0..1 (default 1).\n2648-- `pan?: number`: Stereo position -1 (left) .. 1 (right).\n2649-- `muffle?: number`: 0 (clear) .. 1 (behind a thick wall, under water): a low-pass filter closing down.\n2650-- `pitch?: number`: Pitch shift in semitones.\n2651-\n2652-### type VolumeChannel\n2653-\n2654-```ts\n2655-type VolumeChannel = 'master' | 'sfx' | 'music'\n2628:### interface SpatialOptions\n2629-\n2630-- `ref?: number`: Within this distance (m) the sound is at full volume (default 1).\n2631-- `max?: number`: Silent from this distance on (default 30); it fades out over the last fifth.\n2632-- `rolloff?: number`: How fast it falls off past `ref` (default 1: inverse distance, the way sound really does).\n2633-\n2634-### interface Voice\n2635-\n2636-A looping sound steered while it plays (`AudioManager.loop`): a hum, a fire, a waterfall.\n  177 src/game/ui/ui.js\n   53 src/game/ui/glyphs.js\n  106 src/game/render/carview.js\n  336 total\n7:const RIM_COLOURS = ['mist', 'white', 'sand', 'white'];\n8:const tyreGeom = new Map(), SPOKES = [[1, 'box'], [5, 'box'], [8, 'bar'], [3, 'box']];\n9:function wheelMesh(R, width, style, rimColour) {\n11:  if (!tyreGeom.has(key)) tyreGeom.set(key, new CylinderGeomet