nd(tl())|c:t: 'done'|t:a finished player can follow another ghost\", 727: \"c:hub.on('time-up'\", 728: \"c:hub.on('leave'|c:app.mix.stopAll()\", 729: 't:it never pauses|t:no quit, restart or Dev Mode|t:back closes it|t:Options is ignored while Create is held', 730: 'c:safeName(p?.name', 731: 'c:CONTROLLER OR KEYBOARD REQUIRED',\n  747: 'f:../exit-interview.json', 748: 'c:exit-interview.json', 752: 't:About has ${f}', 753: 't:five sections', 754: \"c:'THREE.JS'|c:'RAPIER'|c:'SWEETIE 16'|c:KIT_CREDITS\",\n  772: I('table header'), 774: 't:on ${k} lap|t:same inputs give the same race|t:tyres wear over distance', 775: 't:has a qualifying car|t:brochure line too long', 776: 't:migrates to the current version', 777: 't:a replayed recording ends on the same fingerprint|t:reset restores music to 10%', 778: 't:no dev tools were used|t:the game is finished', 779: 't:a touch-only device gets the gate|t:the second engine is disposed', 780: 't:spectral centroid rises with rpm|t:tyre squeal is counted|t:is well under a thump', 781: 't:host leaves|t:outside a session it still reaches the title',\n  785: I('a machine note, used in tools/tests/_browser.mjs'), 786: I('a machine note'), 787: 't:no port', 788: I('a machine note, followed'), 789: I('a machine note, followed'),\n  799: 'f:tools/build.mjs|f:tools/test.mjs', 800: 't:same inputs give the same race', 801: 'c:class ChaseCam|c:class EngineSynth', 802: 't:a rolling start|t:all results items', 803: 'c:const DRESS = {', 804: 't:nine buildings on the Map', 805: 't:wins ${id}', 806: 'c:class PitCrew|t:two legs of three wins the rally', 807: 't:attract starts after 10 s idle|t:five sections', 808: 't:host leaves|t:the second engine is disposed', 809: 't:the game is finished', 810: 'f:../exit-interview.json',\n  820: I('table header'), 822: 'f:../exit-interview.json', 823: \"c:export const TITLE = 'GRAN TUMBLEWEED'\", 824: 'f:../exit-interview.json', 825: 'f:tools/build.mjs', 826: 'f:src/pixel-engine.js', 827: 'c:CAR_MODELS', 828: 'c