game \n 856 | ok | - [ ] Every menu item does something. E| test: every item on ${id} does something; test: every car can be obtained; test: every ci\n 857 | ok | - [ ] You looked at the 1080p screensho| not a requirement: done by eye: see the audit notes in the final report \n 858 | ok | - [ ] About/Credits shows real answers.| test: About has ${f}; file: ../exit-interview.json \n 859 | ok | - [ ] No stray servers or browsers of y| not a requirement: checked by process id after each browser run \n\n488\n0","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"returnCodeInterpretation":"No matches found","noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01VrKnHkYQe6ZABTkbaC1MaC","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
